title AVG-06 Rotate and Revoke API Keys and Signing Secret
participant Checker_or_Client_Admin
participant Zetrix_Registry_Admin
participant AVG
==ROTATE API KEY==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:rotate key
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:check max 2 non-revoked keys
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:create new key; set old key Expiring
AVG-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:new key (only hash stored)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:show new key once (then prefix + last 4 only)
AVG->AVG:after 24 h, revoke Expiring key automatically
==REVOKE API KEY==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:revoke key (reason; warning if last active key)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:revoke keyId
AVG->AVG:clear key cache; reject key within 60 s
AVG-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:revoked
==ROTATE SIGNING SECRET==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:rotate signing secret
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:create new secret
AVG->AVG:sign new results with new secret; old secret valid 24 h
AVG-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:new secret (stored encrypted)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:show new secret once
==REVOKE SIGNING SECRET==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:revoke signing secret (reason)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:revoke secret at once
alt TWO NON-REVOKED KEYS ALREADY
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:Revoke the expiring key before rotating again.
end
alt MAKER, VIEWER OR ZETRIX OPS
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:403 access denied
end
